Hold back a quick press of a key the Dana guest just saw released until it has been released for 100 ms of guest time, so a letter typed twice reaches the ROM as two presses. Each released key keeps its own window. Every press keeps a report slot for its own release, so a release is never refused. A session with a newer ST state is reported as saved by a newer Frond.

